    "date": 1711950235,
    "caption": "🚀 We are absolutely thrilled to share the highlights from the «InnoVenture Challenge» 2024 hackathon! \n\nWith a great 150 teams from 6 cities across our nation stepping into the arena, yet, only 21 teams earned their spot in the grand finale hosted at the Astana Hub, with 12 teams dazzling us in person and 9 teams joining online.\n\n💡  The challenges were as diverse as they were pressing, covering three critical areas: \n▫️ tackling environmental issues; \n▫️ crafting technical solutions for citizen engagement; \n▫️ strengthening mental health among the youth.\n\n🤝  We’re immensely proud and grateful for the support from the U.S. Embassy and Chevron in Kazakhstan, alongside our cherished partners The international Technopark of IT startups Astana Hub and the WEC club from Nazarbayev University.\n\n🎉  Congratulations to all the winners!\n\n#innoventurechallenge #chevronkazakhstan #usinkz",
